{"title":"A Cord of Pine","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The Lumberjack Trainer&#39;s cutters are out past town, and the woodpile behind his yard is down to bark.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"lumberjack-trainer\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Skill unlocks</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>The <a href=\"#/guide/lumberjack\">Lumberjack</a> skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/pine-wood\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/ed4497dc146bd38c40c7.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Wood</a> <b>×10</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/lumberjack-trainer\">Lumberjack Trainer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Binxonia)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-19|-20|Lumberjack Trainer\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Cut 10 pine wood and bring it to the Lumberjack Trainer <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/pine-wood\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/ed4497dc146bd38c40c7.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Wood</a> <span class=\"muted\">at -16, -17</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-16|-17|Cut 10 pine wood and bring it to the Lumberjack Trainer\">Show on map</button></li></ol><p class=\"g-note\">Some steps in between were not recorded.</p></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>300</td></tr><tr><td>Lumberjack XP</td><td>300</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/axe\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/b7c5d3219a9ac7f312e7.svg\" alt=\"\">Axe</a></td></tr><tr><td>Unlocks</td><td>the <a href=\"#/guide/lumberjack\">Lumberjack</a> skill</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Lumberjack Trainer says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Lumberjack Trainer:</b> Feet apart, and let the head do the work.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Lumberjack Trainer:</b> Pines grow all through Binxonia, so you won&#39;t have far to walk.</p></div><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Lumberjack Trainer:</b> Ten logs, and you&#39;ve still got all your toes. Good.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Lumberjack Trainer:</b> Keep the axe. The yard can always use more pine if you&#39;re passing with an armful.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"Ten logs, and you&#39;ve still got all your toes. Good.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>A Cord of Pine</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-cord-of-pine\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-cord-of-pine\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-cord-of-pine\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-cord-of-pine\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-cord-of-pine\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Lumberjack Trainer says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-cord-of-pine\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}